{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"8eba75f8ee139643d08f2bfe4157b74dd455a141a3442ebf3b253a7ac0cfa038"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:19a60972c24b60e1cfffc3fa5cd4575d623142947fe4d28d10cdd4a2fed4ecde","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Children","evidence":"[D15:15 | 9:58 pm on 16 August, 2023] Audrey: Yep, pets are family. It's so sweet to see the connection between them. Here's a photo of me lying on the grass with them.\n[D23:18 | 4:22 pm on 13 October, 2023] Audrey: I think i've said this so many times, but I really can't imagine my life without them - my little family. They always make me smile and give lots of love and companionship. Remember I had a tattoo of my four dogs? So I went to the tattoo parlor and got some more drawings on the tattoo.","itemId":"urn:uuid:ce5a613f-5861-5c1a-95d2-af352d499b19","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:0e156f630e2f08af24a8a7f4245f22b8da0abe318999c8b74de3ce50746c6b8a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What does Audrey view her pets as?","referenceAnswer":"Family","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"0e156f630e2f08af24a8a7f4245f22b8da0abe318999c8b74de3ce50746c6b8a"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}